span.p:
in-scope uses (default scope):
decided before SHUTDOWN_REQ;
certificates stated outside teardown

K-TEARDOWN uses: occurrences decided
after SHUTDOWN_REQ (K-LIFE during deletion);
same statuses, reported apart

POWERON restart → shm segments deleted;
not every persisted file, file cache or shared file system (D17 (a)):
the initial state is recorded and checked, not assumed clean
